Vacancy Listing Dates 20/07/2026 to 17/08/2026
Please Quote Reference Number 17714
- Experienced Electronics Technician
- Remuneration - $80,000 - $85,000
- Role based in Robinvale Irrigation District Section C

Davoli Electrical are currently looking for an Electronics Technician to join our team based in Robinvale (Irrigation District Section C).

To be considered for this opportunity, you will need to demonstrate a level of skill commensurate with the equivalent of a trade qualification or higher and at least one year of relevant post trade qualification employment experience OR at least three years of relevant employment experience.

You will be responsible for:
- Assemble, install, repair, troubleshoot and maintain electronic components and systems;
- Source or fabricate replacement parts for electronic systems;
- Ensure that all power and manual tools are operated in accordance with health and safety regulations;
- Liaise with Supervisors and customers to discuss work schedules and time and material cost estimates;
- Provide training and supervision for new technicians and apprentices;
- Carry out scheduled preventative maintenance and servicing equipment;
- Perform equipment demonstrations and draw up training manuals wherever required;
- Interpret drawings, training manuals and instructions in order to perform duties;
- Follow written, verbal, and telephonic instructions;
- Attend regular training workshops and report to the supervisor.

This is a full time position and we are offering an immediate start.

A remuneration package between $80,000 - $85,000 will be offered to the successful candidate.

APPLY NOW through our online application form - https://www.netyourjob.com.au/jobs/17714.php
